{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026u7ewgEWAZA1794469980.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國泰航空接連兩日有航班出現技術原因，需要折返或轉飛其他機場。</p><p></p><p>國泰航空回覆查詢指，周二由倫敦希斯羅機場返港，編號CX252的航班，起飛後因技術原因，按既定程序返回希斯羅機場，已安排乘客轉乘其他航班返港。</p><p></p><p>而昨日由東京成田機場返港的CX521航班，同樣因技術原因，要中途轉飛大阪關西國際機場，並安排乘客轉乘另一航班返港。</p><p></p><p>國泰指工程團隊，會仔細檢查及維修涉事飛機。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T08:23:54.185734+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T06:59:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T08:17:14.987494+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T08:17:14.987494+00:00","content_hash":"bcfd6b32dcf796197bb6f0eb5b52bc21130196b75e02c146788da6caec79f45a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}